{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111767","id":2925159643,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6uWmTb","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111767","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111767.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111767.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111767","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111767/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111767/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111767/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ad02128137a90c27c67bb8733bf51990528e73bd","number":111767,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"SCons: Remove transitive includes in `libc++`","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"- Helps address #111218\r\n- Supersedes #111557 \r\n\r\nI *really* like the idea of the above PR, but the implementation via `typedefs.h` would be inconsistent. It relies on all stdlib headers being defined *after* this header, which is unlikely when it's usually sorted so late in header chains & isn't a universal include for our repo. In order to guarantee this is applied for ALL scripts equally, the define is setup via SCons instead.\r\n\r\nWhile this does the trick of catching overlooked cases early, that's proving to be a bit of a double-edged sword. Most notably: some thirdparty headers are caught in the crossfire, which I'll be gradually cleaning up over the next few days. This implementation currently excludes thirdparty compilation files, but could be expanded to include them as well, given we're already having to touch thirdparty code to *some* extent.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":370471795,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzNzA0NzE3OTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:thirdparty","name":"topic:thirdparty","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milest